105
00:15:19,750 --> 00:15:21,000
Sumi...

106
00:15:22,375 --> 00:15:25,000
Quero ser sua amiga, Sumi.

107
00:15:26,291 --> 00:15:28,708
Segure minha mão, Sumi.

108
00:15:39,291 --> 00:15:41,333
Vamos, Sumi.

109
00:15:42,541 --> 00:15:45,375
